<title>UK: Capital Corp says to publish results shortly.</title>
<headline>Capital Corp says to publish results shortly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British gaming company Capital Corp Plc, which is the subject of a hostile bid by London Clubs International Plc, said on Friday it would soon publish its 1996 results.</p>
<p>&quot;The company's audited results for 1996 will be published shortly and the auditors have confirmed to the board that they expect to issue and unqualified audit opinion,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Capital has rejected LCI's 181.0 million stg bid, arguing that the offer undervalues the firm. It said on Thursday it would send its full response to shareholders by March 18.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
